flowchart LR
    A[Input batch x] --> B[Forward pass through layers]
    B --> C[Predictions y_hat]
    C --> D["Loss L(y, y_hat)"]
    D --> E[Backpropagation: dL/dW]
    E --> F[Optimizer step: Adam / SGD]
    F --> G[Updated weights]
    G --> B
    B -. regularize .-> H[Dropout, weight decay]
    B -. stabilize .-> I[BatchNorm / LayerNorm]
    D --> J{Val loss rising?}
    J -- Yes --> K[Early stop / reduce LR]
    J -- No --> F
